      <segment>
        <source>CheckedItems binding</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckedItems 綁定</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="10" name="CheckedItemsBindingDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckedItems uses TwoWay binding by default and stays in sync when the bound collection changes.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckedItems 預設使用 TwoWay 綁定，並會在綁定集合變更時保持控件狀態同步。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="11" name="CheckAllTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Check all</source>
        <target state="translated">全選</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="12" name="CheckAllDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The indeterminate property can help you to achieve a 'check all' effect.</source>
        <target state="translated">indeterminate 屬性可以幫助實現全選效果。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="13" name="UseWithGridTitle">
