        <target state="translated">結合 Grid 使用</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="14" name="UseWithGridDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>We can use Checkbox and Grid in Checkbox.Group, to implement complex layout.</source>
        <target state="translated">可以在 Checkbox.Group 中結合 Checkbox 和 Grid 實現複雜佈局。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="15" name="PageSubtitle">
